The frontend/ directory
-----------------------

frontend/ is derived from Misskey
(https://github.com/misskey-dev/misskey), Copyright (C) 2014-2026 syuilo and
contributors, licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3
only. The license and copyright notices of the original work are kept in
frontend/LICENSE and frontend/COPYING, and the SPDX headers of the original
files are left unchanged.

- The upstream Misskey version this tree follows is written in
  UPSTREAM_MISSKEY_VERSION.
- frontend/ was imported from the mk-go fork of Misskey
  (https://github.com/shiroha-a/misskey-ts) at tag 2026.10.0-mk.5. The history
  of the modifications made before the import can be followed in that
  repository up to that tag.
- Modifications made to the original work are listed in docs/divergence.md
  (section 4-2) and recorded in this repository's git history.
- The third-party components named in frontend/COPYING (RsaSignature2017 and
  the nsfwjs model) belong to the Misskey backend and are not included in
  frontend/.
